{"study_accession":"PRJNA812326","secondary_study_accession":"SRP362246","title":"Effect of the janus kinase inhibitor ruxolitinib on gene expression of chronic lymphocytic leukemia cells in vivo","description":"Symptomatic previously untreated chronic lymphocytic leukemia patients were treated with the janus kinase (JAK)-inhibitor ruxolitinib (clinicaltrials.gov, number NCT02015208). CLL cells from 6 of the patients were purified prior to commencing ruxolitinib and again 4 or 8 weeks after treatment and analyzed by RNAseq. Ruxolitinib induced a stereotyped response in all patients consisting of a rapid decrease in palpable lymphadenopathy accompanied by increased lymphocytosis and blood lactate dehydrogenase. This response was associated with evidence of inhibited JAK-signaling in CLL cells but activation of other oncogenic pathways. Overall design: Gene expression in circulating CLL cells before and 4-8 weeks after treatment with ruxolitinib were compared by RNAseq.","pubmed":"37114129","geo_series":"","n_samples":12,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN26370451","study_accession":"PRJNA812326","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"IonXpress_016","description":"IonXpress_016","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5930860","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-03-06","attributes":[["source_name","JAK 13 ruxolitinib"],["individual","patient 13"],["disease","chronic lymphocytic leukemia (CLL)"],["tissue","blood"],["cell_type","purified blood CLL cells"],["cell state","ex vivo"],["treatment","ruxolitinib"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR18209649","experiment_accession":"SRX14356220","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Ion Torrent S5 XL","read_count":14837323,"base_count":1757443063,"first_public":"2022-03-06","experiment_title":"Ion Torrent S5 XL sequencing: GSM5930860: IonXpress_016 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN26370452","study_accession":"PRJNA812326","blood_class":"who